  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Given,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#215;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">b</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">a</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mfenced><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">n</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mover><mi>n</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>where,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;the angle between <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math> and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>.&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p>Now, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">a</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#183;</mo><mover><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">b</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">^</mo></mover><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mfenced></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mfenced><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mover><mi>b</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>sin</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>v</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mover><mi>u</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced></math></p>",
